# [SAVNET](../wg/savnet.html)

## Summary

The SAVNET Working Group met at IETF 126. The session was chaired by Joel Halpern (with Ron Bonica co-chairing). The meeting covered updates on active working group drafts and several new proposals focusing on both intra-domain and inter-domain source address validation (SAV) mechanisms, routing security coordination, Internet Exchange Point (IXP) deployments, and SAV monitoring requirements.

