* **Presenter**: Presenter
* **Slide Deck**: [Updates on Inter-domain Source Address Validation based on AS relationships](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/126/materials/slides-126-savnet-updates-on-inter-domain-source-address-validation-based-on-as-relationships-00)
